C*COC*OOCC + O = C*COC*OOCCJ + OH     9.81E+05 2.43 4750.0    !Assume rate rule for primary from Sarathy et al, C8,C&F(2011)degeneracy=3
C*COC*OOCC + O = C*COC*OOCJC + OH     7.66E+05 2.41 1140.0    !Assume rate rule for tertiary from Sarathy et al,C8,C&F(2011)degeneracy=2

