DEC-OOH-13-O2 => CCJOC*OOCCOOH-1 + O2 1.95E+20 -1.201 33370.0 ! Reduce Ea by 7.8 kcal
CJCOC*OOCCOOH-1 + O2 = DEC-OOH-14-O2 4.52E12  0.00  0.00 ! primary site, WJP: use primary rate, Sarathy et al. CF2011

